I go back to the same shop on Sunday morning.
The shopkeeper from yesterday is in the shop.
I go to him.
I say, "Hello bhaiya, I bought a shirt from here yesterday."
The shopkeeper says, "Yes madam, tell me."
I take the new shirt out of my bag.
I show him the shirt and say, "Bhaiya, this shirt is very small for me."
"I want to exchange this shirt."
The shopkeeper looks at the shirt.
He asks, "Madam, do you have the receipt?"
I take the receipt out of the bag and give it to him.
I ask, "Do you have a big size of this shirt?"
"I need a size bigger than this."
The shopkeeper looks at the receipt.
He says, "Yes madam, we have a shirt bigger than this."
"You wait one minute, I will bring it right now."
I smile and wait in the shop.
